        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-483, Flower Cabinet Door Knob Backplate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Daisy Cabinet Knob Rose is sure to brighten up any home. The Daisy Knob Backplate is designed so that every petal seems to flow into the next. It can be used with any cabinet knob including the matching <a href=\"/products/daisy-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-183\">Daisy Knob</a> and the <a href=\"/products/white-flower-porcelain-cabinet-knob-with-polished-brass-rk-international-ck-321\">Porcelain Flower Cabinet Knob</a>. It is available in polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel finishes. It has a 1-1/2 inch diameter.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/daisy-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-183\"><b>CK-183 Daisy Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-483 Daisy Knob Backplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
